# wave 68: `npx wrangler dev` (DEPLOY.md step 6) creates .wrangler/{cache,state,tmp} in the repo root, and
# step 8 two lines later is `git add -A`. The document reassures you that node_modules/ and dist/ are both
# already here; the one it does not name is the one the preceding step creates.
.wrangler/

# wave 106 (THE ARK): tools/gate/server.py generates a self-signed pair here on first run.
# A private key is never a repository's business, and this one is trusted by nothing anyway.
.certs/

# Local credentials and environment overrides must never enter a checkpoint.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
